1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Coffee cooling by the window,

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Morning folding into gold.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,200
You say, "Take your time,

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,180
There's nowhere that we have to be today."

5
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:31,000
So we leave the door half-open,

6
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:35,500
Let the quiet fill the space.

7
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:39,220
Every little breath feels lighter

8
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:42,700
When I see your smiling face.

9
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,000
Come on, sing it with me,

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,240
One small note, then two, then three.

11
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,600
Let the worries lose their way,

12
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,480
We can start again today.

13
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,700
Come on, sing it with me,

14
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,980
Low and soft or wild and free.

15
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,160
Nothing fancy, nothing planned,

16
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:03,500
Just your voice beside my hand.

17
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:10,000
Kettle humming in the kitchen,

18
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:14,000
Dust is dancing on the shelf.

19
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,500
You turn an ordinary Tuesday

20
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:23,000
Into somewhere I can rest.

21
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,300
And the road can wait till later,

22
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:31,180
There is plenty here to hold:

23
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:35,840
A worn-out chair, a folded blanket,

24
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:40,000
And a story left untold.

25
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,720
Come on, sing it with me,

26
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,000
One small note, then two, then three.

27
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,340
Let the worries lose their way,

28
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:49,200
We can start again today.

29
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:51,460
Come on, sing it with me,

30
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,740
Low and soft or wild and free.

31
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:55,880
Nothing fancy, nothing planned,

32
00:01:55,880 --> 00:02:00,500
Just your voice beside my hand.

33
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:06,340
If the day gets loud around us,

34
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:10,340
If the sky forgets to clear,

35
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:15,300
I will leave a place beside me,

36
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:20,000
You can always meet me here.

37
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:24,180
Come on, sing it with me,

38
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:26,520
One small note, then two, then three.

39
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,760
Let the worries lose their way,

40
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,620
We can start again today.

41
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:32,900
Come on, sing it with me,

42
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:35,180
Low and soft or wild and free.

43
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:37,360
Nothing fancy, nothing planned,

44
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:41,500
Just your voice beside my hand.

45
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:50,500
Just your voice beside my hand,

46
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:59,000
Take your time, I understand.

